</section>
<section id="A8.SS4.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Hyperparameters for expert distillation</h5>

<div id="A8.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A8.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The hyperparameters of BC and <math id="A8.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathtt{DAgger}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝙳𝙰𝚐𝚐𝚎𝚛</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathtt{DAgger}</annotation></semantics></math> are provided in <a href="#A8.T3" title="In Hyperparameters for expert distillation ‣ H.4 Experiment Details ‣ Appendix H Supplemental Materials for Experiments ‣ To Distill or Decide? Understanding the Algorithmic Trade-off in Partially Observable Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> and <a href="#A8.T4" title="In Hyperparameters for expert distillation ‣ H.4 Experiment Details ‣ Appendix H Supplemental Materials for Experiments ‣ To Distill or Decide? Understanding the Algorithmic Trade-off in Partially Observable Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> respectively. Note that the only exception is that <math id="A8.SS4.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathtt{DAgger}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝙳𝙰𝚐𝚐𝚎𝚛</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathtt{DAgger}</annotation></semantics></math> is run for 6500 episodes in the motor noise 0.1 and 0.3 experiment because it converges slower than the rest of the experiments.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A8.T3" class="ltx_table">
