<figure id="A8.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Hyperparameters for <math id="A8.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathtt{DAgger}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝙳𝙰𝚐𝚐𝚎𝚛</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathtt{DAgger}</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
